          </div>
          <div style="background: #161022; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #a855f7; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #c9a227; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700;">Haunted Harvest Economy Strategy</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.55;">
              Candy is the dedicated seasonal token currency for the Haunted Harvest event. It does not provide base character stat boosts directly, but is exchanged at the town Halloween vendor for event-limited cosmetic weapon variants and rare enhancement scrolls. Because holiday currency cycles out when the event concludes, players should redeem OCTOBER immediately upon starting and spend the candy before the next weekly update clears the seasonal merchant stall.
            </div>
